  m_Name: Evento_DoacaoInternacional
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Doa\xE7\xE3o Internacional"
  _titleEn: International Donation
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Fundos e governos estrangeiros \xE0s vezes financiam projetos locais,
    principalmente ambientais e sociais."
  _summaryEn: Foreign funds and governments sometimes finance local projects, mainly
    environmental and social ones.
  _realWorld: "O Fundo Amaz\xF4nia, criado em 2008 e gerido pelo BNDES, recebeu doa\xE7\xF5es
    principalmente da Noruega e da Alemanha para combater o desmatamento."
  _realWorldEn: The Amazon Fund, created in 2008 and managed by Brazil's development
    bank BNDES, received donations mainly from Norway and Germany to fight deforestation.
  _tradeOffs: "A doa\xE7\xE3o vem com condi\xE7\xF5es e pode ser suspensa; projetos
    que dependem dela precisam de plano para continuar."
  _tradeOffsEn: Donations come with conditions and can be suspended; projects that
    depend on them need a plan to continue.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Fundo Amaz\xF4nia (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundo_Amaz%C3%B4nia
